Hi,

I am trying to use read.arff from the RWeka package together with JRI but 
I do not manage to get it right. In my java program I would like to read in a 
file in arff-format using read.arff, and then call R functions on the resulting 
data frame. 

My try (which fails):

Rengine re = new Rengine(args,false,null);
re.eval("library(RWeka)");
String filename = "\"filename.arff\"";
REXP myarff = re.eval("data = read.arff(" + filename + ")");
int type = myarff.getType(); //FAILS WITH java.lang.NullPointerException

Thankful for any help.

Best,
Matt

