Apple has removed Java header files from OS X 10.6.5 and later. You will have to either download the Java Development Kit from Apple (ADC at http://connect.apple.com/ ) or re-configure R to use headers from the SDK if you have them installed -- see 
http://www.mail-archive.com/r-sig-mac at r-project.org/msg00004.html

Cheers,
Simon

