Jurgis,

you can make the loader verbose using:

cl = .jclassLoader()
cl$verbose=TRUE

and you should see something like:

> .jcall("J",,"foo")
RJavaClassLoader at 33dff3a2.findClass(J)
RJavaClassLoader: found class J using URL loader

Also try simply
.jfindClass("Sampler3")
to see that it's not some signature issue. 

Cheers,
Simon

